# Railway deploy workflow

TheNutraMarket deploys to Railway from GitHub `main` (`https://github.com/mwkohler3/TheNutraMarket`).

After completing user-requested code changes for this project:

1. Commit relevant changes with a clear message (do not commit secrets, `.env`, or `data/leads.json`).
2. Push to `origin main` unless the user explicitly says not to deploy.
3. Tell the user the commit hash and that Railway will redeploy in ~1–3 minutes.

Do not ask "want me to push?" — push by default when work is done.
